   <text>
      <body>
         <p>[...]<ref target="n1" xml:id="r1" n="1"/></p>
         <p>The same authority informs us that an American Rough, whose name is WALT WHITMAN, and who calls himself a "Kosmos," has been publishing a mad book under the title "<hi rend="italic">Leaves of Grass</hi>." Surely there is a misprint here for <hi rend="italic">Want</hi> Whitman; and as for the "Kosmos," if he does <hi rend="italics">cause moss</hi>, he is the worst in the world to have anything to do with grass.</p>
     </body>
